{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06530","headline":"使过弹筝峡作 · 储光羲","name":"使过弹筝峡作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟雀知天雪，羣飞复羣鸣。\n原田无遗粟，日暮满空城。\n达士忧世务，鄙夫念王程。\n晨过弹筝峡，马足凌兢行。\n双壁隐灵曜，莫能知晦明。\n皑皑坚冰白，漫漫阴云平。\n始信古人言，苦节不可贞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}